WEBVTT

00:02:30.236 --> 00:02:33.396
For people like me,
people in sacrifice zones

00:02:33.436 --> 00:02:35.396
that are also leading a just transition

00:02:35.396 --> 00:02:38.556
away from the subtractive model
of development

00:02:38.596 --> 00:02:42.876
to one that feels just for all of us,

00:02:42.916 --> 00:02:44.796
in the name of climate justice.

00:02:45.476 --> 00:02:47.396
So what is climate justice?

00:02:48.276 --> 00:02:49.436
It's simple.

00:02:49.796 --> 00:02:50.956
If ...

00:02:51.316 --> 00:02:54.916
climate change was created
by economic and racial injustice,

00:02:54.956 --> 00:02:57.196
then effective solutions
to the climate crisis

00:02:57.196 --> 00:03:00.836
have to include
economic and racial justice.